csas-pohoda (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewritten statement_sync: configuration from the environment, date range
    or symbolic period, installed tools instead of hardcoded paths
  * Command csas-pohoda, exit codes 1 (download) and 2 (import failed)
  * New package multiflexi-csas-pohoda with the application definition
    (Csas and mServer credentials)
  * Depends on csas-statement-tools and pohoda-abo-importer

